    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara is delighted to present 2 Kenilworth Lane East to the open market, a deceptively spacious mews residence c. 1216.32 sq.ft / 113 sq.m.\r\nOne of three similar style properties constructed in recent years with all brick exterior, parking and south facing garden.\r\nWonderfully proportioned, full of natural light and positioned within a short walk of Rathmines, Rathgar and Harold’s Cross Villages. Beside schools, bus routes, sports facilities and easy access to the city centre and M50.\r\nComprising large kitchen/dining, utility, w.c., lounge with picture window overlooking garden.\r\n3 bedrooms (2 en-suite), bathroom.\r\nOutside is parking to front, South facing garden to rear."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen/dining\r\nRange of wall and floor units, sink unit. Tiled floor. Extractor. \r\n\r\nInner Hall\r\nUtility, w.c.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nWood flooring, Door and window to garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1\r\nFitted wardrobe, ensuite shower room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nEnsuite shower room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nAutomatic shutter to parking, South facing rear garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "c. 1216.32 sq.ft /113 sq.m \r\nDouble Glazed \r\nParking\r\nSouth facing rear garden\r\nBeside Rathmines, Rathgar, Harold’s Cross Villages.\r\nConvenient to M50 and City Centre."
      },
      {
